  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Discover the answers to these and many more questions on the evening tours of ETH Zurich’s Collections and Archives as well as the administrative department Services. You can also follow in the footsteps of Albert Einstein or get to know ETH Zurich's Hönggerberg campus.\n\nThe free tours always take place on Tuesdays from 18.15 to 19.15.\n\nFind out about the dates and topics"
    }
